<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>JARVIS - Official App</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0f172a;
      color: #f8fafc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 24px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .card {
      background: #1e293b;
      max-width: 540px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #0ea5e9;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.9rem; }
    .price { color: #34d399; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    p { color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6; }
    .btn {
      display: block;
      background-color: #10b981;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 15px 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 22px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="badge">ANDROID APP</div>
    <h1>JARVIS</h1>
    <div class="price">&#8377;99</div>
    <p>Smart assistant app designed to help with everyday tasks, quick commands, and productivity.</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn">Buy Now &bull; &#8377;99</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
